{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0104_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0cb691c75a2f08b31df41ed817a54be0c796e36e5080fdab95cfecd8bd46ccff", "ja": "（今日は瑞希が演じる支配人のラストシーンの\n撮影だった。物語の、重要なシーンだったな……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄瑞希饰演的经理最后的一幕。\n我记得这是故事中很重要的一幕……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0104_1001_p", "source_sha256": "390040aee836999470f05a81fc057c494fd5eab7ab3d5e0382f0ef4ce66ae92e", "ja": "瑞希、お疲れさま。クライマックスシーンの\n迫真の演技、すごく良かったよ。", "zh": "瑞希，辛苦你了。\n你在剧情高潮时那逼真的演技，真的很精采喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0104_1003_p", "source_sha256": "71c111d1c75378b144e339b07366a566d6520828035d19143c8bb9bfd9d707fe", "ja": "瑞希？", "zh": "瑞希？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0104_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "7615806a51496fffd7eec00a83f24bcbd3d05cb94de2438aa2f68233f60e752f", "ja": "はっ！？\n……{$P$}。", "zh": "啊！？\n……{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0104_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "9085e719a210d63192a01d8884f51d7b693839ec0de788dc3c30de44272e8c78", "ja": "すみません。さっきまで支配人だったせいか、\n自分のことを呼ばれていると気づきませんでした。", "zh": "抱歉，可能是因为我直到刚刚都在扮演经理，\n才没注意到你是在叫我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0104_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "efbe765545af2ad6ea043778ffbf5d7a01de003bb8e44a2c19bd426d0818a750", "ja": "私は、アイドルの真壁瑞希。真壁瑞希。\n……よし。いつも通りだぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "我是偶像真壁瑞希，真壁瑞希。\n……好，就跟平常一样了，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0104_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0b14b7ee2c23820a33fcef8ee6089558fb98a85f6beb98aa40b60ffe65ab3a5a", "ja": "そうか……名前を呼ばれても気付かないなんて、\nそれだけ役に入り込んでたって事だな。", "zh": "原来是这样……就算叫你名字也没注意到，\n看来你真的非常投入角色呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0104_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "28f9057d7a32df6a9dc4e368b3333ac2e44de9021932c2ed16e8ebfae42c03ed", "ja": "はい。私なりに支配人のことを考えて、\n気持ちが伝わるよう、たくさん練習しました。", "zh": "是的，我用自己的方式去揣摩经理这个角色。\n为了将他的感受表现出来，做了很多练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0104_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "e13c0884346186b68f53a4eab9918686642abe0636c6684761d5ac26e8aedeef", "ja": "結末は、他の人が見たら、不幸かもしれません。\nでも支配人の場合は、自分で選んだことでもあります。", "zh": "就他人看来，经理的结局或许很不幸。\n不过对经理来说，这是他自己的选择。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0104_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "82a1de412f4cdda4e867559f4aee1121d9ad8c089cab85f065423f0a7535e67e", "ja": "だから、精いっぱいがんばりました。\n……支配人の気持ち、伝えられたかな。", "zh": "所以，我真的非常努力去扮演。\n……不知道有没有把经理的心情传达出去了呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0104_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3c329dc07c0e142fd91fd0c361141c2123b1de3c993418cdcf7dcd7b150f7d64", "ja": "そうか。……うん。\n瑞希の……支配人の気持ちは、きっと伝わるよ。", "zh": "原来如此……嗯。\n我想瑞希的……经理的心情，一定能传达给大家的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0104_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "cd9e261f8774cdbbc94ec3765b9a59191158f618ba40bbfdb31e6a93db1f4710", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとうございます。\n……そうだといいな。", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你。\n……真是如此就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0104_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "edfa3293a2abe7e7402ca758315825133acb653751785b0f8fd10b17208f7e3a", "ja": "この役が決まってからずっと、支配人のことばかり\n考えていました。お風呂に入っているときも、ずっと。", "zh": "自从决定由我饰演以来，我一直都在思考经理这个角色。\n就连泡澡的时候也不例外。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0104_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "80feb8dc11c98c791ecc887a9cac18b756015a3189adefeae0c70edef48643d2", "ja": "おかげで、何度かのぼせてしまいました。\n……うっかり。", "zh": "也因为如此，我有好几次都泡昏头。\n……太大意了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0104_1015_p", "source_sha256": "29e2b68b602c4e62bf1c37c8fbfb5852255698aff398239abe24546ba8588fb1", "ja": "いや、それは気をつけて……瑞希に何かあったら困る。\n何はともあれ、撮影が無事終わってよかったな。", "zh": "不，你得小心点才行……要是发生什么意外就不得了啦。\n但不管怎么说，拍摄能够平安结束真是太好了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0104_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9915229c2f8d6e22b7913d66093f5b253e6654f99ca4b06a417293cb3ca74da2", "ja": "瑞希が役について一生懸命考えたからこそ、\n物語の重要なシーンが、しっかりと締められたんだ。", "zh": "正因为瑞希拚命揣摩这个角色，\n故事中的重要场景才能够划下完美句点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0104_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "5d19c64c8defc991ea34fe59fd0cab5ec6ee972d292615b7ef1556f418d80e53", "ja": "はい。……{$P$}。\nこれもひとつの、愛の形、でしょうか？", "zh": "嗯……{$P$}，\n这也是一种爱的形式吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0104_1018_p", "source_sha256": "3ffdb109542260d20a1784749b0861e3a5c6fe8c97d94d05f7fa75f006a03412", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。でも、そのつけヒゲのまま\n言われると、なんだか説得力が……。", "zh": "嗯，对啊。不过，你戴着那副假胡子说这种话，\n总觉得没什么说服力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0104_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "e98e302036f70370ae1ac698ca236b16f52b589bd4f8c0ba9664c2fa0e80e715", "ja": "はっ。……忘れていました。\nけど、このつけヒゲは私のお気に入りなので。", "zh": "啊……我都忘记了。\n不过，我很中意这副假胡子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0104_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "e47e7403d62b86c944e24ac26ae165c8876b94c997fca2d13ffbd89a647f09c1", "ja": "私の撮影は、これでもう、終わりなので。\n今日は最後まで、この姿でいようと思います。", "zh": "我的拍摄工作就到此结束了。\n所以我打算，今天直到最后都要维持这身打扮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0104_1021_p", "source_sha256": "96b5d6274ed6c302c168bccfdaff4e5fbd9a84f9f78a5627f73bb9c7afb313c8", "ja": "（瑞希は名残惜しそうに、つけヒゲに触れていた。\n……難しい役、最後までよく頑張ったな。お疲れ様！）", "zh": "（瑞希看似依依不舍地摸着假胡子……直到最后，\n你都这么努力扮演如此艰难的角色，真是辛苦你了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
